      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I had the same problem, as someone who is medically unable to speak and finds chatbox essential for communication, typing normally and then very suddenly being stopped from communicating mid conversation has been very irritating. It has gotten to a point I sign to friends that my chatbox is broken! something recognisable by most people who know me well.\n\nSometimes it will stop working, I will type one or two words and mid typing I will again no longer be allowed to type. \n\nThis is all while people have constantly misuse chatbox by using magic chatbox and seem to have no issues.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
