      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Desktop user (playing through GeForce NOW) and touch typist here.\n\nThis is indeed a problem! Especially when there's nothing that states me and the rest when it happens. At best, they think I'm typing something long, and at worst they think I'm just typing and deleting what I'm typing out of regret.\n\nEven out of the accessibility angle, I need to communicate through text because it lets me chat at night when my family doesn't want to hear me talk, even when I try to speak as quietly as possible.",
