  "details": "Ever since the chatbox \"Send Text Automatically\" live typing feature came out, I feel like I've been rated limited much more often just trying to chat normally. The chatbox stops working for maybe a minute, and the worst part is there's no indication that you've been rate limited, or when it's fine again.",
